{"summary":"遂石是一种产于泰山阴处的矿石，味甘、无毒，能益气，主治消渴（糖尿病）和中气损伤，全年可采。","sections":[{"kind":"names","title":"释名","original":"《别录》曰︰味甘，无毒。主消渴伤中，益气。生泰山阴，采无时。","translation":"《别录》记载：味甘，无毒。主治消渴和中气损伤，能益气。产于泰山北面，采集没有固定时间。"},{"kind":"form","title":"集解","original":""},{"kind":"preparation","title":"修治","original":""},{"kind":"properties","title":"气味","original":""},{"kind":"uses","title":"主治","original":""},{"kind":"commentary","title":"发明","original":""},{"kind":"prescriptions","title":"附方","original":""}],"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%B6%B1%E7%9B%AE%2F%E9%87%91%E7%9F%B3%E4%B9%8B%E4%BA%94#遂石","retrievedAt":"2026-07-05T14:00:57.612Z"}